<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Tele North Qld declares special div.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Tele North Qld declares special div.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecasters North Queensland Ltd said on Tuesday it had declared a special unfranked dividend of 40 cents per share, payable on December 20.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
